Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 16:30:37 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 197/260] [ae-patch] Truncate a family lead's title at its
 hover actions, as a standalone row does

On hover, focus inside the actions or an open menu, a lead row's title now ends at the pin's left edge (106px from the right) instead of running on under a fade, where it stayed readable behind the pin, archive and kebab buttons. The fade is gone; the chevron, time and spinner slots still never move.
